                                "sense_id": "469361cc-14f8-314a-bcae-7c972dc9c03e",
                                "text": "Both see Leviathan more as a photograph than a metaphor — a reality veiled by rhetoric — and thereby claim a position of epistemic privilege, a Realpolitik, a discourse shorn of humbuggery and pretense."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d03fbf5d-9782-4fed-bd9e-534d9821fbfe",
                                "sense_id": "469361cc-14f8-314a-bcae-7c972dc9c03e",
                                "text": "Peale, however, was never accused of humbuggery — not in his entertainments, not in his marketing strategies, and above all not in his public persona."
